From d8a28054028cc0388c77b70a43f7950ab2ce3365 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sun, 1 Nov 2026 00:09:09 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 11/51] Deoxys formes and the Meteorite

- Attack, Defense and Speed Formes are their own species, reusing three
  unused placeholder slots (Speed Forme sprites from pret/pokeemerald)
- Plain Deoxys is now the Normal Forme (sprite, icon and stats)
- The Meteorite (returned on catching Deoxys at Birth Island) cycles
  Normal -> Attack -> Defense -> Speed when used on Deoxys

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01JQmLEZftLdDmGYX3wiQ71G
